  164                                 .         jump (\1)


                                        src/gpu/ox.gas       Page 19      5:01:00 pm 29-Sep-2026        RMAC 2.1.01 (Linux/OSX)


  165                                 .         addq #6,r30                ; Determine Return Address
  166                                 .         ENDM
