  652                                   ;*
  653                                   ;* Generate a Mode 7 surface (no rotate)
  654                                   ;*
  655                                   ;* Inputs: 0=Source screen base; 4=Max Z (16:16); 8=Offset (16:16); 12=FE Height, 16=Zmax height (both 16:16)
